# server/

The gRPC server crate for Udex, implementing IndexService and EntryService handlers, JWT validation and authorization middleware, TLS transport, structured logging, and configuration validation. Contains the main server startup logic, service implementations, authentication interceptors, and configuration management. Includes integration tests, TLS certificates, and JWT fixtures for local testing.

## Dirs

- `benches/` -- Criterion benchmarks for Entry service operations and related functionality
- `src/` -- Core gRPC server implementation with service handlers, middleware, and configuration
- `tests/` -- Integration tests and test fixtures for server, services, TLS, and JWT auth

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Package metadata, dependencies (tonic, tokio, sqlx, etc.), and features
- `README.md` -- Crate documentation, module layout, server setup, and authorization details
